      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;connectivity-devices-and-cable-types&#34;&gt;Connectivity Devices and Cable Types&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In computer networks, various &lt;strong&gt;connectivity devices&lt;/strong&gt; are used to interconnect network components and ensure proper data communication. Different &lt;strong&gt;cable types&lt;/strong&gt; are also essential for transmitting data between devices. Understanding these devices and cables is fundamental for network design, maintenance, and troubleshooting.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;connectivity-devices&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connectivity Devices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.rohanbatra.in/posts/digital-communication-and-networks/2025-05-03-network-devices--hub/&#34;&gt;Hub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.rohanbatra.in/posts/digital-communication-and-networks/2025-05-03-network-devices--switch/&#34;&gt;Switch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.rohanbatra.in/posts/digital-communication-and-networks/2025-05-03-network-devices--router/&#34;&gt;Router&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.rohanbatra.in/posts/digital-communication-and-networks/2025-05-03-network-devices--bridges/&#34;&gt;Bridge&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.rohanbatra.in/posts/digital-communication-and-networks/2025-05-05-network-devices---gateways/&#34;&gt;Gateway&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;cable-types&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cable Types&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.rohanbatra.in/posts/digital-communication-and-networks/twisted-pair-cable/&#34;&gt;Twisted Pair Cable&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Used in Ethernet networks and commonly seen in &lt;strong&gt;Cat 5e&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Cat 6&lt;/strong&gt; cables.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.rohanbatra.in/posts/digital-communication-and-networks/coaxial-cable/&#34;&gt;Coaxial Cable&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Historically used for &lt;strong&gt;Ethernet networks&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;cable TV&lt;/strong&gt; connections.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.rohanbatra.in/posts/digital-communication-and-networks/fiber-optic-cable/&#34;&gt;Fiber Optic Cable&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Offers high-speed data transmission and is used for long-distance communication.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;</description>
